    "notes": "<p>The starship of the klicks - the pincered aliens the Concord Marines named for the sounds they make - encountered in the Hammer's Star system. Concord scientists cannot identify its armour, have not deciphered the crew's language, and have classified the species as external to every charted system.</p><p>The first engineering space carries no random-damage band, so a d20 cannot single it out.</p>",
